SUMMARY:Little Park Pals: Pumpkin Playtime at Gulf State Park
LOCATION:Gulf State Park Nature Center\, 22120 Campground Road\, Gulf Shore
 s\, AL 36542
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 10/29 · 10:00 AM\n\nGulf State Park naturalists run a
  pumpkin themed program for children ages 5 and under. Kids hear a pumpkin
  story\, plant their own pumpkin seed and make a festive pumpkin craft to 
 take home. Parents must be present but do not need to register.\n\nPrice: 
 from $5\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-little-park-pal
 s-pumpkin-playtime-1029.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-little-park-pals-pumpkin-playtim
 e-1029.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
