UID:ev_blakeley_seafood_cruise_1030-2026-10-30@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261030T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261030T201500
SUMMARY:Seafood buffet dinner cruise from Five Rivers
LOCATION:Bartram dock\, Five Rivers Delta Resource Center\, AWF Delta and B
 ay Conservation Center at Five Rivers\, Spanish Fort\, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/30 · 5:30 PM to 8:15 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley State P
 ark runs an early evening cruise from the Bartram dock at Five Rivers acro
 ss the lower Mobile-Tensaw Delta and Mobile Bay at sunset. The boat ties u
 p at the Original Oyster House for a seafood buffet that includes Florenti
 ne stuffed flounder\, blackened shrimp Alfredo and popcorn shrimp. The tic
 ket includes the meal\, and the cruise returns to Five Rivers by 8:15 PM.\
 n\nPrice: from $49\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blak
 eley-seafood-cruise-1030.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-seafood-cruise-1030.htm
 l
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
