DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Delta Discovery cruise from Five Rivers
LOCATION:Bartram dock\, Five Rivers Delta Resource Center\, AWF Delta and B
 ay Conservation Center at Five Rivers\, Spanish Fort\, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 10:00 AM and 1:00 PM · Sunday 11/1 · 1:30 P
 M\n\nHistoric Blakeley State Park runs 90-minute boat trips into the Mobil
 e-Tensaw Delta\, which the park calls the American Amazon. The boats leave
  from the Bartram dock at the AWF Delta and Bay Conservation Center at Fiv
 e Rivers. The park lists two departures on Saturday\, October 31\, at 10:0
 0 AM and 1:00 PM\, and one on Sunday\, November 1\, at 1:30 PM.\n\nPrice: 
 from $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-delta
 -discovery-1031.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-delta-discovery-1031.ht
 ml
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
