DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nHalloween at the farm\,
  with candy handed out at spots around the property while supplies last an
 d a candy cannon firing at scheduled times through the day. Normal farm ad
 mission applies and the maze and pumpkin patch are open. Saturday hours ar
 e 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM.\n\nPrice: from $18.50\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-sweet-season-trick-or-treat-1031.html
