SUMMARY:Halloween Critters of the Night at Gulf State Park
LOCATION:Gulf State Park Nature Center\, 22120 Campground Road\, Gulf Shore
 s\, AL 36542
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 1:00 PM\n\nGulf State Park naturalists lead a
  Halloween themed look at the Gulf Coast animals that are active after dar
 k. Visitors bring a flashlight\, meet live animal ambassadors and learn ho
 w nocturnal creatures adapt. The program is best suited to ages 8 and up.\
 n\nPrice: from $3\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hallo
 ween-critters-of-the-night-gulf-state-park-1031.html
