SUMMARY:Audubon program: Arizona Sky Islands
LOCATION:Chandler Center\, Room 800\, Crosspoint Church\, 519 Helms St\, Ni
 ceville\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 11/5 · 7:00 PM (socializing 6:30 PM)\n\nChoctawhatche
 e Audubon Society hosts a slide show program on birding in the high desert
  and mountain ranges of southern Arizona. A guest speaker shares experienc
 es from the Sky Islands\, the isolated mountain ranges that rise out of th
 e desert. The program starts at 7:00 PM\, with socializing from 6:30 PM\, 
 and is free and open to the public.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-audubon-sky-islands-program-1105.html
