 ds a Saturday morning bird walk at Twin Hills Park in Crestview. The two l
 arge ponds are likely to hold ducks\, coots\, cormorants\, herons and egre
 ts\, along with songbirds in the surrounding trees. The group meets at 7:3
 0 AM in the parking lot by the children's park.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails:
