UID:ev_blakeley_bottle_creek_mounds_1121-2026-11-21@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T123000
SUMMARY:Excursion to the Bottle Creek Indian Mound Complex
LOCATION:Live Oak Landing\, boarding point for Historic Blakeley's Bottle C
 reek excursion\, Live Oak Landing\, off Alabama State Highway 225\, Stockt
 on area\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/21 · 9:00 AM to 12:30 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley Stat
 e Park takes guests by boat to the Bottle Creek site\, which has 18 earthe
 n mounds built centuries ago by Native Americans and was once one of the l
 argest communities in the Southeast. The site is reachable only by water. 
 Guests board at Live Oak Landing\, less than a mile north of I-65 in the S
 tockton area\, and walk about a half mile on the island.\n\nPrice: from $3
 5\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-bottle-creek
 -mounds-1121.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-bottle-creek-mounds-112
 1.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_blakeley_fall_color_cruise_1121-2026-11-21@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T150000
SUMMARY:Fall Color in the Delta Cruise at Historic Blakeley
LOCATION:Historic Blakeley State Park\, 34745 State Hwy 225\, Spanish Fort\
 , AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/21 · 1:00 PM to 3:00 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley State
  Park runs a relaxing seasonal cruise through the scenic backwaters of the
  upper Mobile-Tensaw Delta. Cooler temperatures and thinner vegetation in 
 late fall open up views of the Delta\, and hardwood trees add a hint of co
 lor to an otherwise green landscape. The cruise runs from 1:00 PM to 3:00 
 PM on Saturday 11/21.\n\nPrice: from $5\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventur
 es.com/events/ev-blakeley-fall-color-cruise-1121.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-fall-color-cruise-1121.
 html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
